<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Burj Khalifa: architect, builder &amp; engineering | Tallest Building in the World</title><meta name="description" content="828 metres tall, Burj Khalifa is a mixed-use skyscraper in Dubai, United Arab Emirates. It ranks first among the world's tallest completed buildings by architectural height."><link rel="canonical" href="https://tallestbuildingintheworld.com/buildings/burj-khalifa/"><meta name="robots" content="index,follow"><meta name="theme-color" content="#f8f9f6"><script>(()=>{let theme;try{theme=localStorage.getItem('building-theme');}catch{}document.documentElement.dataset.theme=theme==='light'||theme==='dark'?theme:matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches?'dark':'light';})();</script><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:title" content="Burj Khalifa: architect, builder &amp; engineering"><meta property="og:description" content="828 metres tall, Burj Khalifa is a mixed-use skyscraper in Dubai, United Arab Emirates. It ranks first among the world's tallest completed buildings by architectural height."><meta property="og:url" content="https://tallestbuildingintheworld.com/buildings/burj-khalifa/"><meta property="og:site_name" content="Tallest Building in the World"><meta property="og:image" content="https://tallestbuildingintheworld.com/img/buildings/burj-khalifa.webp"><meta property="og:locale" content="en_US"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta name="twitter:title" content="Burj Khalifa: architect, builder &amp; engineering"><meta name="twitter:description" content="828 metres tall, Burj Khalifa is a mixed-use skyscraper in Dubai, United Arab Emirates. It ranks first among the world's tallest completed buildings by architectural height."><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://tallestbuildingintheworld.com/img/buildings/burj-khalifa.webp"><link rel="icon" href="